This C program interfaces with an AZDelivery KY-026 Flame Sensor Module and an MCP3008 ADC via SPI on a Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+ using the pigpio library. It reads the digital output (D0) on GPIO4 and the analog output (A0) on MCP3008 channel 0, samples the analog reading, and approximates the ambient temperature using a linear map. It logs timestamped CSV rows to `flame_data.csv` once per second. The program includes robust error handling, signal handling for graceful termination, and ensures clean resource release on all exit paths.

