This C program reads distance from a Sharp GP2Y0A21YK0F IR distance sensor using the sysfs GPIO interface on GPIO 17. It converts the digital input to a placeholder voltage, calculates the distance using the provided formula, logs each reading with a timestamp, and activates a pet feeder if the distance is below 200 mm. The program handles GPIO file open or read errors gracefully and cleans up resources on SIGINT or SIGTERM.

