This code provides a complete solution for measuring distance with an HC-SR04 ultrasonic sensor on a Raspberry Pi Zero W using the libgpiod library. It includes error checking, resource management, and a signal handler to ensure clean exit on SIGINT. The distance is logged with an ISO 8601 UTC timestamp to a file.

