This C program interfaces with a Sensirion SDP810-125Pa differential pressure sensor using the standard Linux I2C i2c-dev interface on a Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+. It sends the continuous measurement command, waits for the conversion time, reads the sensor data, validates the CRC-8 checksums, converts the raw data to pressure in Pa and temperature in °C, logs the timestamp, pressure, and temperature to a CSV file named 'airflow.csv' every 1 second, and handles graceful shutdown on SIGINT and SIGTERM.

