This code provides a complete solution for reading pressure and temperature from a TDK ICP-10101 sensor using the pigpio library on a Raspberry Pi Zero W. It includes error handling, calibration data reading, sensor data reading, and logging of readings with timestamps. The program also handles graceful shutdown with SIGINT and SIGTERM signals.

