This C program interfaces with a Sensirion SDP800-500Pa differential pressure sensor using the Linux i2c-dev kernel interface. It sends the continuous-measurement command, waits for the sensor to respond, reads the data, validates the CRCs, converts the raw values to pressure and temperature, logs the data to a file, and handles signals to exit gracefully.

