This code provides a complete solution for reading temperature and pressure from a Bosch BMP280 sensor over I2C on a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B. It includes error handling, signal handling for graceful exit, and logging of sensor data with timestamps. The code uses the Linux i2c-dev interface and adheres to modern C programming practices.

