This C program for a Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+ reads humidity from a DHT22 sensor on BCM GPIO 4 and POSTs the humidity value as JSON to a specified server URL using libcurl. It uses the pigpio library for GPIO operations and handles errors gracefully, including retries and signal handling for graceful shutdown. The program logs to syslog and can be configured with a custom server URL via a command-line option.

