This C program actively manages the Raspberry Pi 5 Active Cooler by reading the CPU temperature and adjusting the fan state based on a tiered speed map. It logs every fan speed change with a timestamp and handles graceful shutdown via SIGINT and SIGTERM. The program checks for errors in file operations and retries on transient failures.

