This C program uses the pigpio library to interface with a Silicon Labs Si1145 UV Index and Ambient Light sensor on I2C bus 1 at address 0x60. It initializes the sensor, configures it, and continuously reads UV index and Visible ALS data, printing the readings to the console and logging them to a CSV file named 'uv_als_log.csv'. It handles potential I2C errors and sensor-absent/bus-error paths gracefully and implements clean resource release on all exit paths, including signal handling for SIGINT and SIGTERM.

