This code sets up a Raspberry Pi to read touch input from a SainSmart TTP223B capacitive touch sensor connected to GPIO 17 and toggle an LED connected to GPIO 18 on each rising edge of the touch signal, with software debounce. It uses the libgpiod library for GPIO operations and handles cleanup on signals.

