This code initializes the BH1750 sensor in One-Time High-Resolution mode, reads the lux value, maps it to the APA102 LED strip's brightness, and sends an APA102 frame to control the LED brightness. It handles SIGINT to gracefully turn off the LEDs and close resources. Error handling is implemented for I/O operations, sensor initialization, and SPI communication.

