This code provides a complete solution for interfacing with a KY-026 flame sensor on a Raspberry Pi 5 using the libgpiod library. It includes a self-test, main loop, and signal handling for graceful cleanup. The code logs all events with timestamps and handles errors by signaling the error with a distinct pattern.

