This code sets up a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B to monitor two TI DRV5032 digital Hall-Effect sensors connected to GPIO17 and GPIO27. It logs the sensor states to 'conveyor_log.txt' every 50 ms with millisecond precision. If both sensors read logic 1, it simulates halting the conveyor by printing a message. The program handles GPIO access errors, log file I/O errors, and graceful shutdown on SIGINT and SIGTERM signals.

