This code provides a complete solution for interfacing with the MMA8452Q accelerometer over I2C on a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B using the Linux i2c-dev kernel interface. It includes error handling, resource management, and a signal handler to ensure proper cleanup on termination. The program continuously polls the accelerometer, computes the tilt angle of the X-axis relative to gravity, and logs the raw values to a file when the tilt angle exceeds 45 degrees.

