This code initializes the LIS3MDL magnetometer over I2C, configures it for continuous conversion mode, and logs the magnetic field data to a file. It also checks for a metal detection threshold and prints a warning if exceeded. The program handles errors, retries initialization, and cleans up resources on exit.

