This code provides a complete solution for reading angular rates from an MPU-9250 gyroscope over SPI on a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B using libgpiod for GPIO control and the standard spidev interface. It includes error handling, resource cleanup, and logging of sensor data with timestamps. The program runs indefinitely until interrupted by a signal.

