This code initializes the pigpio library, sets up the GPIO pins for the motors and encoders, registers an ISR for the encoder inputs, and implements a closed-loop PI controller for speed control. The controller runs at a 100 ms period, and it handles SIGINT to stop the motors and release resources cleanly. It also detects encoder stall and prints a warning if it occurs. The motor RPM and PWM duty cycle are printed each control iteration.

