This code initializes the pigpio library, opens the I2C bus, and opens the log file. It sets up signal handlers for graceful shutdown. The main loop sends a command to the BH1750 sensor, waits for the measurement to complete, reads the lux data, and controls the relay based on the lux value. It logs all sensor readings and relay state changes. The program cleans up resources on all exit paths, including graceful shutdown via SIGINT and SIGTERM.

